@startuml
participant "AI APP" as App
participant "MCP Gateway" as GW
participant "MCP Server" as MCP
participant "Tool" as Tool

App -> GW : Request available tools
GW -> MCP : Forward tool discovery request (user context)
MCP --> GW : Send list of tools and their capabilities
GW --> App : Send user-specific list of tools\n(scoped to this user's permissions)
note over App : AI APP chooses tool

App -> GW : Call chosen tool
note over GW : Check host permissions for tool\nCheck call rate within permitted limit
GW -> MCP : Forward tool call and data
MCP -> Tool : Send tool request and data
note over Tool : Tool processes data
Tool --> MCP : Return result
MCP --> GW : Send tool response
GW --> App : Send tool response
@enduml
